# Copy to .env to override environment/infra config (config/settings.py's
# Settings) without editing configs/app.yaml - deployment-topology facts
# only (which port to bind, where the data volume lives), never
# application behavior. See configs/*.yaml (models.yaml, research.yaml,
# transcript.yaml, tts.yaml) for everything else - those aren't
# env-overridable by design (docs/architecture.md's "Config hygiene").
# ROLEPLAY_HOST=127.0.0.1
# ROLEPLAY_PORT=8000
# ROLEPLAY_DATA_DIR=/absolute/path/to/data
# ROLEPLAY_LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# Only needed if a game sets provider: openai / anthropic (configs/providers.yaml) - unused otherwise.
# OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-...
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...
